{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30375","headline":"送张又新除温州 · 赵嘏","name":"送张又新除温州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东晋江山称永嘉，莫辞红斾向天涯。\n凝弦夜醉松亭月，歇马晓寻溪寺花。\n地与剡川分水石，境将蓬岛共烟霞。\n却愁明诏徵非晚，不得秋来见海槎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30375.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30375","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}